  "observations": [
    "The previous full-height red-haired actor and 鞘から刀身が出ていないということは… panel remain until 243.289, then disappear at 243.323–243.423. The scene is black behind persistent recording/game HUD through 244.556.",
    "A separate square illustration fades in at 244.589–244.856, occupying the portrait screen width while retaining black above and below. The image is an overhead view of a small pink/red-haired figure in white/blue clothing beside a diagonally placed straight sword, on blue floorboards. Its sword guard, hilt winding, floor seams, splinter patches and coat/shoulder ornament match the original ADV_pic_103006 pixels.",
    "The new picture speech panel enters at 244.923–245.156, with ラインハルト and こちらの剣でお相手させてもらいます。ご不満ですか？. The square image remains unchanged through the complete line until 249.023. The JP name identifies the panel; illustration identity was determined from image details and the native resource, not that name.",
